  "title": "Erdős Problem #973",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Does there exist a constant $C>1$ such that, for every $n\\geq 2$, there exists a sequence $z_i\\in \\mathbb{C}$ with $z_1=1$ and $\\lvert z_i\\rvert \\geq 1$ for all $1\\leq i\\leq n$ with $ \\max_{2\\leq k\\leq n+1}\\left\\lvert \\sum_{1\\leq i\\leq n}z_i^k\\right\\rvert < C^{-n}? $ ",
